- Section 6: $2x_{61} + 3x_{62} + 1x_{63} + 2x_{64} + 4x_{65} + 5x_{66} + 1x_{67} + 6x_{68} + 3x_{69} + 4x_{6,10} \leq 110$
- Section 7: $2x_{71} + 3x_{72} + 1x_{73} + 2x_{74} + 4x_{75} + 5x_{76} + 1x_{77} + 6x_{78} + 3x_{79} + 4x_{7,10} \leq 160$
